WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.608
Open Data Table to organise information from the selected source.

00:00:01.608 --> 00:00:03.993
Describe the rows and columns before generating the comparison table.

00:00:03.993 --> 00:00:06.529
Open the generated table and compare the three processes side by side.

00:00:06.529 --> 00:00:09.978
Expand the table to read the evidence and misconception columns.

00:00:09.978 --> 00:00:12.498
The table menu offers Export to Sheets for further editing.
